{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A team based top-down shooter game. Pick up weapons and fight enemies with allies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> # Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You pick from two sides, Royal knights or Skydow warriors to play as. Eliminate all enemies in the arena to win. Join The-Third-Force as a mercenary if both sides are not for you. When play as a mercenary, eliminate all players including other mercenaries to win.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various types of weapons help you make your own tactics. No repetitive weapon type in this game. Every weapon comes with different special abilities as well to make every battle unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"># Story Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addictive and challenging missions in the story mode open up the world of Twilight Wars. Play with AI or your friends to adventure in the post-apocalyptic earth, find out the truth of the catastrophe 700 hundreds years ago.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Crude Merc. Tag","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096550/cca58c6bc1d4d1d849ef368b4c743190111b9828.jpg"},{"name":"Heraldry of Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096550/61fb31459336a9f15b39f4abe0e4a58e9840b6ca.jpg"},{"name":"Royal Temporary Pass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096550/36f574fb7ca92e5d01db65fce1198453bb007b33.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Merc. Tag","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096550/4d3d3b9580c0047195b2d674109440453b9d2f1c.jpg"},{"name":"Badge of Royal Regular Army","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096550/c063b07c55d10cd20c26ff350422031a7cb02330.jpg"},{"name":"Heraldry of Sighted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096550/df9b10a6ecdad2614e3004a0c26a1d5491f18934.jpg"},{"name":"X-Chall